OL,3,AAnthropic warns of AI's 'risks to
OL,4,Ahumanity' ahead of blockbuster share
OL,5,Alisting
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnthropic has said artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence could pose "catastrophic
OL,9,For existential risks to humanity" as it
OL,10,Funveiled details of its planned
OL,11,Fblockbuster stock market listing in the
OL,12,FUS.
OL,14,FThe company behind AI chatbot Claude
OL,15,Frevealed losses of more than $80.7bn
OL,16,F(#60.5bn) in the first half of the
OL,17,Fyear, but it said it had $112.4bn in
OL,18,Fcash or equivalents, and generated
OL,19,Frevenues of $16.3bn over the same
OL,20,Fperiod.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
